      prior_hash_matches: true,
      excerpt: "1. **Taray\u0131c\u0131 container'\u0131 bellek s\u0131n\u0131r\u0131nda \xF6ld\xFCr\xFCl\xFCyor.** Splitter (UI-11)\n   aday\u0131n\u0131n 51 testlik birle\u015Fik regresyonu 4,3 saniyede bo\u015F \xE7\u0131kt\u0131yla\n   `TDD_BROWSER_REPORT_MISSING` veriyordu; container \xE7\u0131k\u0131\u015F kodu 137; Colima VM\n   kernel g\xFCnl\xFC\u011F\xFC: `Memory cgroup out of memory: Killed process \u2026 (headless_shell)`\n   / `(MainThread)`. 2 GB s\u0131n\u0131rla ayn\u0131 aday 3/3 PASS; \xF6rneklenen tepe bellek\n   887\u2013942 MiB (2\u20133 testte ~600 MiB \u2192 test ba\u015F\u0131na ~6 MiB birikim). UI-10 ayn\u0131\n   imza; UI-05 ayn\u0131 s\u0131n\u0131r alt\u0131nda \"page.goto: Page crashed\" (renderer \xE7\xF6kmesi).\n2. **Tip \xE7al\u0131\u015Ft\u0131r\u0131c\u0131s\u0131 projenin ambient bildirimlerini derlemiyordu.**\n   `runtime/type-tests/driver.cjs` yaln\u0131z se\xE7ili testleri k\xF6k dosya al\u0131yor,\n   `types:[]` kullan\u0131yordu; projenin `src/vite-env.d.ts` (`/// <reference\n   types=\"vite/client\" />`) dosyas\u0131 derlemeye girmiyordu. Payla\u015F\u0131ml\u0131\n   `registry.ts` (`import.meta.glob`) i\xE7eren her tip testi\n   `TDD_TYPE_COMPILER_ERROR` (TS2339) ile stage hatas\u0131na d\xF6n\xFC\u015F\xFCyordu (Team 2).\n3. **Bi\xE7imsiz TDD iste\u011Fi stage'i d\xFC\u015F\xFCr\xFCyordu.** Team 3'\xFCn `revise_test` iste\u011Fi\n   se\xE7ili test dosyas\u0131yla birebir olmayan de\u011Fi\u015Fiklik seti ta\u015F\u0131d\u0131;\n   `TDD_TEST_REVISION_PATH` `StopJob` olarak worker'a kadar \xE7\u0131kt\u0131 ve i\u015F ERROR",
