      sha256: "df2405d5bab45d9f986c66b8eec7673c5893001009bebb5a5d56210a25660a60",
      prior_hash_matches: true,
      excerpt: "### P0-3 \u2014 Te\u015Fhis agent'\u0131n\u0131n g\xF6revi ile eri\u015Fimi \xE7eli\u015Fiyor\n\n**Do\u011Frudan kan\u0131t:** bak\u0131m \xE7a\u011Fr\u0131s\u0131 `51cf5584-674f-4ef1-8ed5-705f0ec79a1d` COMPLETED; \xE7\u0131kt\u0131 \u201CINCIDENT.json okunamad\u0131, yerel dosya okuma arac\u0131 yok, komut \xE7al\u0131\u015Ft\u0131rmak yasak\u201D diyor. Maintenance request SUCCESS ve blockage `step=diagnosed`; ancak ger\xE7ek hata te\u015Fhis edilmemi\u015F.\n\nOlay dosyas\u0131: [INCIDENT.json](/Users/w6x/Developer/software-factory/projects/.impediments/2f4281a4-32be-5634-a442-6abbbb9cd266/diagnosis/INCIDENT.json). SHA256: `9bec9b91fdf553677e3458302ac3d67a734ccdf47bc082d3caada544fe090279`.\n\n[Te\u015Fhis prompt'u](/Users/w6x/Developer/software-factory/factory_blockage_worker.py:315) dosyay\u0131 okumay\u0131 istiyor, komut \xE7al\u0131\u015Ft\u0131rmay\u0131 yasakl\u0131yor. [Model girdisi](/Users/w6x/Developer/software-factory/factory_maintenance.py:409) dosyan\u0131n kendisini de\u011Fil talimat\u0131 iletiyor. [Codex SDK adapt\xF6r\xFC](/Users/w6x/Developer/software-factory/runtime/sdk/codex.mjs:70) \xF6zel dosya okuyucu sa\u011Flam\u0131yor; proje dok\xFCman\u0131 otomatik y\xFCkleme de kapal\u0131.\n\n**Gereken:** boyutu s\u0131n\u0131rl\u0131 ve s\u0131rlardan temizlenmi\u015F olay i\xE7eri\u011Fini yap\u0131land\u0131r\u0131lm\u0131\u015F girdiye eklemek veya yaln\u0131z ilgili salt okunur dosyay\u0131 okuyabilen ara\xE7 sa\u011Flamak. Bunun i\xE7in geni\u015F yazma/shell yetkisi a\xE7mak gerekmiyor. \u201CDosyay\u0131 okuyamad\u0131m\u201D \xE7\u0131kt\u0131s\u0131 te\u015Fhis ba\u015Far\u0131s\u0131 de\u011Fil, `NEEDS_EVIDENCE` gibi ayr\u0131 bir sonu\xE7 olmal\u0131. Kabul testi ger\xE7ek kullan\u0131lan SDK/hesap yolunda dosyadaki bilinen kan\u0131t\u0131n okunabildi\u011Fini g\xF6stermeli.\n\n### P0-4 \u2014 Y\xF6netim kayd\u0131 ile ger\xE7ek onar\u0131m aras\u0131nda eksik y\xFCr\xFCtme ad\u0131m\u0131\n\nPush/pull g\xF6zlem, sorumlu atamas\u0131 ve eskalasyon var. Fakat profilsiz te\u015Fhisten yeni onar\u0131m\u0131n haz\u0131rlanmas\u0131 \u2192 ba\u011F\u0131ms\u0131z do\u011Frulanmas\u0131 \u2192 uygulanmas\u0131 \u2192 eski i\u015Fin g\xFCvenli devam\u0131 zinciri genel olarak tamamlanm\u0131\u015F de\u011Fil.\n\n`record_repair_observation` bir ART kayd\u0131 yazar; **worker ba\u015Flatmaz**. Risk OWNED, kay\u0131t SENT, \xE7a\u011Fr\u0131 COMPLETED veya handoff COMPLETE tek ba\u015F\u0131na onar\u0131m/\xFCr\xFCn ba\u015Far\u0131s\u0131 de\u011Fildir. [factory_art_runtime.py:63](/Users/w6x/Developer/software-factory/factory_art_runtime.py:63), [factory_blockage_worker.py:469](/Users/w6x/Developer/software-factory/factory_blockage_worker.py:469), [onar\u0131m yap\u0131land\u0131rmas\u0131](/Users/w6x/Developer/software-factory/config/self-repair.json).\n\n**Gereken:** RTE'nin karar\u0131, belirli y\xFCr\xFCt\xFCc\xFCye ve makinece do\u011Frulanabilir \xE7\u0131kt\u0131ya ba\u011Flanmal\u0131. Mevcut a\xE7\u0131k vaka korunmal\u0131; yeni isimle ayn\u0131 i\u015Fi a\xE7\u0131p b\xFCt\xE7e veya deneme s\u0131n\u0131r\u0131 a\u015F\u0131lmamal\u0131. Te\u015Fhis i\xE7in gelen model cevab\u0131, uygulanabilir onar\u0131m profili olarak kendili\u011Finden kabul edilmemeli.",
      checked: "2026-09-27",
      kind: "historical_handoff"
