      kind: "historical_report",
      excerpt: "## Do\u011Frulanan k\xF6k nedenler (canl\u0131 kay\u0131t + pmset g\xFCnl\xFC\u011F\xFC)\n\n1. **Scheduler lease kayb\u0131 = Mac'in kapak kapal\u0131 uykusu.** `pmset -g log`:\n   04:40:33 'Clamshell Sleep', ard\u0131ndan 'Maintenance Sleep' / DarkWake pencereleri.\n   Her uyku giri\u015Fi iki ekibin son heartbeat'iyle saniyesi saniyesine e\u015Fle\u015Fiyor\n   (05:29:46 \u2192 hb 05:29:45/48; 05:48:31 \u2192 05:48:23; 06:04:57 \u2192 06:05:02;\n   06:24:50 \u2192 06:24:36/51, yerel saat). Uyan\u0131\u015Fta (06:40:07) lease 120 s TTL'i\n   ge\xE7mi\u015F oldu\u011Fundan `heartbeat()` `lease_until>now()` \u015Fart\u0131n\u0131 sa\u011Flayam\u0131yor,\n   worker'\u0131n `lost` bayra\u011F\u0131 kal\u0131c\u0131la\u015F\u0131yor ve bir sonraki guard `SCHEDULER_LEASE_LOST`\n   yaz\u0131yor (job g\xFCncellemesi 06:40:08/09). Worker s\xFCreci \xF6lmemi\u015Fti; sahiplik\n   kimseye ge\xE7memi\u015Fti. `caffeinate -i` kapak kapanmas\u0131n\u0131 engellemez.\n2. **Zombi slot + kapasite kilidi.** Worker s\xFCresi dolmu\u015F lease ile `release_stage`\n   yapam\u0131yordu (ayn\u0131 `lease_until>now()` \u015Fart\u0131). UNKNOWN kalan iki slot\n   `max_slots=2` kapasitenin tamam\u0131n\u0131 tuttu; `worker_launch_budget` 0 d\xF6nd\xFC ve\n   Team 3/7/9 hi\xE7 ba\u015Flamadan kuyrukta bekledi. Slot ancak recovery `_requeue`",
