      line_end: 75,
      kind: "historical_report",
      excerpt: "## Uygulanan de\u011Fi\u015Fiklikler (kaynak hash'leri `activation-manifest.json`)\n\n- `factory_scheduler.py`: `_renew` \u2014 sahiplik (lease, worker pid, stage lease)\n  \xFC\xE7l\xFCs\xFCd\xFCr; s\xFCresi dolmu\u015F ama devral\u0131nmam\u0131\u015F lease ayn\u0131 canl\u0131 s\xFCre\xE7te yenilenir,\n  UNKNOWN slot RUNNING'e d\xF6ner. RECOVERED/RELEASED slot, yeniden kuyru\u011Fa al\u0131nm\u0131\u015F\n  veya ba\u015Fka lease'li stage, ba\u015Fka worker pid, de\u011Fi\u015Fmi\u015F generation veya iptal\n  edilmi\u015F root asla canlanmaz; `max_stage_seconds` sert s\u0131n\u0131r\u0131 korunur.\n  `revive_lease` \u2014 guard taraf\u0131nda, 741941 kilidi olmadan, \xE7a\u011F\u0131ran\u0131n kendi\n  transaction'\u0131nda tek ad\u0131ml\u0131k canland\u0131rma. `assert_current_lease` kat\u0131 kald\u0131.\n  `release_stage` \u2014 sahibi s\xFCresi dolmu\u015F/UNKNOWN slotunu kapatabilir.\n  `reconcile_stale` \u2014 stage art\u0131k o lease ile \xE7al\u0131\u015Fm\u0131yorsa ve pid `ABSENT`\n  do\u011Frulanm\u0131\u015Fsa zombi UNKNOWN slot `RELEASED/ZOMBIE_SLOT_RECONCILED` olur; stage\n  h\xE2l\xE2 RUNNING ise veya pid do\u011Frulanam\u0131yorsa dokunulmaz.\n- `factory_worker.py`: `_pulse_loop` \u2014 ge\xE7ici DB hatas\u0131 yeniden denenir, yaln\u0131z\n  kesin `False` sahiplik kayb\u0131d\u0131r; ilk hata ayr\u0131nt\u0131s\u0131 loglan\u0131r. `_lease_guard` \u2014\n  kat\u0131 assert, sonra tek `revive_leas",
