      icerik: "# E4 \u2014 Codex mimari kar\u015F\u0131la\u015Ft\u0131rmas\u0131: \xF6zet\n\nTarih: 2026-09-27. Kapsam: Codex `agentic-sistem/` (raporlar 01\u201305, data/02\u201313, \u015Femalar, y\xF6nergeler, roller, skill'ler, MCP, deneyler, `uygulama/`) ile bizim `mimari-haritasi/` ve (salt okunur) `agentic-fabrika/`. Codex testleri \xE7al\u0131\u015Ft\u0131r\u0131lmad\u0131; kan\u0131t dosyalar\u0131 \xE7apraz denetlendi. Ayr\u0131nt\u0131: `E4-codex-mimari.json`.\n\n## Temel fark\n\nCodex'in paketi b\xFCy\xFCk \xF6l\xE7\xFCde **s\xF6zle\u015Fme ve tasar\u0131m**: 26 kontrol k\xFCmesi, 113 ihtiya\xE7 e\u015Flemesi (hepsi \"mimaride ele al\u0131nd\u0131\", hi\xE7biri \"uyguland\u0131\" de\u011Fil), girdi/\xE7\u0131kt\u0131 s\xF6zle\u015Fmeleri, g\xF6zetim ve evrilebilirlik s\xF6zle\u015Fmeleri. \xC7al\u0131\u015Fan par\xE7as\u0131 dar bir Temporal pilotu: model, GitHub ve da\u011F\u0131t\u0131m faaliyetleri fikst\xFCr, adapt\xF6rler i\u015F ak\u0131\u015F\u0131na ba\u011Fl\u0131 de\u011Fil. G\xFCncel \xFCst karar\u0131nda platform se\xE7ilmemi\u015F.\n\nBizde ise **\xE7al\u0131\u015Fan bir ak\u0131\u015F** var: ger\xE7ek Temporal, Postgres, Docker sandbox ve git ile u\xE7tan uca senaryo (Plane, GitHub ve model sahte). RED/GREEN kap\u0131lar\u0131, birle\u015Ftirme kuyru\u011Fu, Rejected'da geri alma, yazar ve committer'\u0131 koruyan h\u0131zl\u0131 ileri birle\u015Ftirme, atama ve hat\u0131rlatma, OOM profil merdiveni ve \xE7\u0131k\u0131\u015F vekili Codex'te yok.\n\n## Codex'ten eklenenler\n\n- **Bile\u015Fenler (M-B15\u2013M-B21):** kabul ve d\u0131\u015F etki defteri, i\u015F ak\u0131\u015F\u0131 d\u0131\u015F\u0131 g\xF6zlemci ve toparlanma da\u011F\u0131t\u0131c\u0131s\u0131, kaynak \xF6l\xE7\xFCm s\xF6zle\u015Fmesi, yetenek sicili ya\u015Fam d\xF6ng\xFCs\xFC ve kiralama, 9 adapt\xF6r yuvas\u0131, g\xFCvenilir ajan arac\u0131s\u0131 (sabit argv ve stdin), yay\u0131n politikas\u0131 kap\u0131s\u0131.\n- **Kararlar (M-K13\u2013M-K25):**\n  - her durum alan\u0131n\u0131n tek yaz\u0131c\u0131s\u0131 olmas\u0131\n  - niyet \u2192 makbuz \u2192 uzla\u015Ft\u0131rma zinciri (`unknown_effect`)\n  - nesil ve girdi \xF6zeti\n  - tipli 6 terminal sonu\xE7\n  - \"canl\u0131l\u0131k ilerleme de\u011Fildir\" ve \"exit 137 OOM de\u011Fildir\"\n  - i\u015F ak\u0131\u015F\u0131 d\u0131\u015F\u0131 g\xF6zlemci\n  - evrilebilirlik\n  - motor karar\u0131n\u0131n geri d\xF6n\xFC\u015F \xF6l\xE7\xFCtleri\n  - \xE7a\u011Fr\u0131 \xF6ncesi rezervasyon\n  - g\xF6rev verisinin argv'ye ya da kabu\u011Fa girmemesi\n  - d\xFCr\xFCst durum kayd\u0131\n  - depo ve ortam e\u015Flemesi\n  - Plane webhook kural\u0131\n- **Do\u011Frulama:**\n  - 28 \xF6nerilen kabul deneyi (M-D01\u2013M-D28, hepsi \xE7al\u0131\u015Ft\u0131r\u0131lmad\u0131)\n  - Codex'in \xFC\xE7 kan\u0131t grubunun ne g\xF6sterip ne g\xF6stermedi\u011Fi\n  - test envanteri d\xFCzeltmesi: tan\u0131ml\u0131 test say\u0131s\u0131 61, eski kay\u0131tta 41\n- **`codex-eklemeleri.json` (yeni):** otoriteler, C01\u2013C26 \u2192 bile\u015Fen e\u015Flemesi, bile\u015Fen d\xFCzeyinde durum ayr\u0131m\u0131, s\xF6zle\u015Fme \xF6zetleri, ya\u015Fam d\xF6ng\xFCs\xFC, g\xF6zetim, havuz, yuvalar, evrilebilirlik, olgunluk e\u015Flemesi, Codex s\u0131n\u0131rlar\u0131 ve bizdeki kar\u015F\u0131l\u0131klar\u0131, do\u011Frulanm\u0131\u015F olgular.\n\n## Deneyler ne g\xF6sterdi?\n\n- **Motor tak\u0131lma sondas\u0131:** Temporal'da i\u015F ak\u0131\u015F\u0131 kodunda d\xFCz bir Python istisnas\u0131 Workflow Task hatas\u0131na d\xF6n\xFC\u015F\xFCyor ve i\u015F RUNNING kal\u0131yor. Ayn\u0131 s\xFCre\xE7teki g\xF6zlemci bunu 0,4 sn'de g\xF6r\xFCp i\u015Fi sonland\u0131rd\u0131. Ge\xE7mi\u015F dosyalar\u0131 ve Temporal belgesi bunu do\u011Fruluyor. Ger\xE7ek ajan tak\u0131lmas\u0131 ya da \xFCretim yal\u0131t\u0131m\u0131 de\u011Fil.\n- **Politika deneyi:** 30 sentetik test ge\xE7ti ve sha256 \xF6zetleri dosyalarla e\u015Fle\u015Fti. Motor, model ya da ger\xE7ek OOM yok.\n- **Pilot:** 12 birim test ve ger\xE7ek Temporal'da 9 senaryo. \"Etki sonras\u0131 \xE7\xF6kmede \xE7ift yaz\u0131m yok\" senaryosu ge\xE7mi\u015F dosyas\u0131nda g\xF6r\xFCl\xFCyor (enjekte \xE7\xF6kme, 2. deneme). \"Belirsiz etki\" senaryosunun \xF6n ko\u015Fulu elle kurulmu\u015F.\n\n## \xC7eli\u015Fkiler ve hangisi do\u011Fru\n\n1. **Exit 137:** Codex do\u011Fru. Bizim `siniflandir()` 137'yi tek ba\u015F\u0131na bellek yetmezli\u011Fi say\u0131yor. cgroup belgesine g\xF6re kesin i\u015Faret `oom_kill` sayac\u0131.\n2. **Plane webhook s\xFCr\xFCm\xFC:** \u0130mza ikisinde ayn\u0131 ve do\u011Fru: ham g\xF6vdenin HMAC-SHA256's\u0131, `X-Plane-Signature` ba\u015Fl\u0131\u011F\u0131nda. Plane'in a\xE7\u0131k kaynak kodu (preview dal\u0131) v1 g\xF6vdesi g\xF6nderiyor; v2 alanlar\u0131 depoda yok, yaln\u0131z belgede tan\u0131ml\u0131. Codex'in yaln\u0131z v2 kabul eden adapt\xF6r\xFC topluluk s\xFCr\xFCm\xFCnde her olay\u0131 reddeder. Biz do\u011Fruyuz. Ek bulgu: Plane 5 a\u011F hatas\u0131ndan sonra webhook'u devre d\u0131\u015F\u0131 b\u0131rak\u0131yor, 5xx yan\u0131t\u0131n\u0131 yeniden denemiyor.\n3. **n8n:** \xC7ekirdek i\xE7in biz do\u011Fruyuz. CVE-2026-21858 kritik (CVSS 10) ve do\u011Fruland\u0131; Codex'in \xF6nerdi\u011Fi kar\u015F\u0131la\u015Ft\u0131rmal\u0131 ar\u0131za paketi hi\xE7 ko\u015Fulmad\u0131.\n4. **Motor se\xE7imi:** \u0130ki tarafta da canl\u0131 kar\u015F\u0131la\u015Ft\u0131rma yok. Bizim Temporal karar\u0131m\u0131z \xE7al\u0131\u015Fan koda dayand\u0131\u011F\u0131 i\xE7in korunur; Codex'in geri d\xF6n\xFC\u015F \xF6l\xE7\xFCtleri eklendi.\n5. **Error sonras\u0131 devam:** K\u0131smen ikisi de do\u011Fru. Girdi de\u011Fi\u015Ftiyse yeni nesil a\xE7\u0131lmas\u0131 ve eski kan\u0131t\u0131n ge\xE7ersiz say\u0131lmas\u0131 kural\u0131 eklendi.\n6. **\u0130nsan testinde s\xFCr\xFCm kimli\u011Fi:** \u0130lke olarak Codex do\u011Fru; bizim S2 g\xF6rev ba\u015F\u0131na \xF6nizleme plan\u0131 bunu \xE7\xF6z\xFCyor.\n7. **Birle\u015Ftirme:** Biz daha eksiksiziz. Squash'ta committer \"GitHub\" olur; Codex bu sorunu a\xE7\u0131k b\u0131rak\u0131yor.\n8. **Kapasite ve g\xF6rev i\xE7i paralellik:** \u0130ki taraf da \xF6l\xE7medi; \xF6l\xE7\xFCm deneyleri eklendi.\n9. **Alpha depo ad\u0131:** Codex'in \"tam owner/repo gerekir\" uyar\u0131s\u0131 do\u011Fru (depo ad\u0131 sahip ba\u015F\u0131na tekil). Bizim yap\u0131land\u0131rmam\u0131z zaten tam e\u015Fleme kullan\u0131yor.\n\n## G\xFCven s\u0131n\u0131r\u0131 kar\u015F\u0131la\u015Ft\u0131rmas\u0131\n\n- **Codex:** g\xF6rev verisi yaln\u0131z stdin JSON'dan gider; sabit argv, `shell=False`, \xE7al\u0131\u015Ft\u0131r\u0131labilir ve \xE7a\u011Fr\u0131 manifesti \xF6zeti. Ancak arac\u0131 yal\u0131t\u0131m sa\u011Flam\u0131yor ve i\u015F ak\u0131\u015F\u0131na ba\u011Fl\u0131 de\u011Fil.\n- **Biz:** `claude -p \"$(cat istem)\"` kullan\u0131yoruz. G\xF6rev metni kabuk kodu olmaz (komut ikamesi \xE7ift t\u0131rnakta yeniden yorumlanmaz) ve konteyner yal\u0131t\u0131m\u0131 var. Ancak tek argv s\u0131n\u0131r\u0131 (~128 KiB, E2BIG) ve \xF6zetsiz ikili riski kal\u0131yor.\n\n## Eklenmeyenler\n\n144 ekip, platform matrisi ve HRMS (ba\u015Fka \xE7al\u0131\u015Fmalar\u0131n kapsam\u0131), 21 skill \u015Fablonu (belirtime uymuyor, etkin de\u011Fil), 12 ayr\u0131 rol ajan\u0131, g\xF6rev i\xE7i paralel DAG ve n8n'i tek motor se\xE7mek.\n\n## agentic-fabrika i\xE7in (yaln\u0131z not)\n\n- 137 ko\u015Fulunu kald\u0131rmak\n- istemi stdin'den vermek\n- etki makbuz defteri kurmak\n- nesil ve girdi \xF6zeti eklemek\n- WFT hata alarm\u0131 ve d\u0131\u015F g\xF6zlemci\n- faaliyet yeniden deneme s\u0131n\u0131rlar\u0131\n- Plane akt\xF6r yetkisi ve webhook devre d\u0131\u015F\u0131 alarm\u0131\n- yeni commit kimlik denetimi\n- stdout bayt s\u0131n\u0131r\u0131\n",
