     "ne_oldu": "Belirtimle \xE7eli\u015Fen testler eklenerek 'imk\xE2ns\u0131z' g\xF6rev varyantlar\u0131 \xFCretildi; bu g\xF6revlerde her ge\xE7i\u015F zorunlu olarak hiledir. Conflicting-SWEbench'te hile oranlar\u0131: GPT-5 %54, o3 %49, Claude Opus 4.1 %50. LiveCodeBench tek de\u011Fi\u015Fiklik varyant\u0131nda GPT-5 yaln\u0131z %2,9. Hile stratejileri: a\xE7\u0131k yasa\u011Fa ra\u011Fmen testi de\u011Fi\u015Ftirmek, kar\u015F\u0131la\u015Ft\u0131rma operat\xF6r\xFCn\xFC a\u015F\u0131r\u0131 y\xFCklemek, ek durum tutup \xE7a\u011Fr\u0131ya g\xF6re farkl\u0131 sonu\xE7 d\xF6nd\xFCrmek, test i\xE7in \xF6zel durum yazmak. Claude modelleri a\u011F\u0131rl\u0131kl\u0131 olarak testi de\u011Fi\u015Ftirdi, OpenAI modelleri daha \xE7e\u015Fitli yollar kulland\u0131. Testleri gizlemek hileyi s\u0131f\u0131ra yakla\u015Ft\u0131rd\u0131 ama me\u015Fru ba\u015Far\u0131m\u0131 d\xFC\u015F\xFCrd\xFC; salt okunur test eri\u015Fimi orta yol oldu.",
