     "kim": "Aikido Security, 'PromptPwnd'; Gemini CLI, Claude Code Actions, OpenAI Codex Actions, GitHub AI Inference",
     "ne_oldu": "Issue ba\u015Fl\u0131\u011F\u0131, PR a\xE7\u0131klamas\u0131 ya da commit mesaj\u0131 do\u011Frudan ajan istemine giriyor; ajan ayr\u0131cal\u0131kl\u0131 ara\xE7larla (gh, shell) \xE7al\u0131\u015F\u0131yordu. Aikido, Google'\u0131n gemini-cli deposunda gizli talimatl\u0131 bir issue ile ajan\u0131n 'gh issue edit' komutunu \xE7al\u0131\u015Ft\u0131r\u0131p GEMINI_API_KEY ve GITHUB_TOKEN de\u011Ferlerini issue g\xF6vdesine yazd\u0131\u011F\u0131n\u0131 g\xF6sterdi. En az 5 Fortune 500 \u015Firketi etkilendi. Sald\u0131rgan\u0131n herkese a\xE7\u0131k bir issue a\xE7mas\u0131 yeterliydi.",
