     "onlem": "Ajan i\u015Flerini ayr\u0131 ve ge\xE7ici runner'da, ayr\u0131 \xF6nbellek anahtar\u0131yla \xE7al\u0131\u015Ft\u0131r\u0131n. Yay\u0131n i\u015Finde \xF6nbellek kullanmay\u0131n ya da \xF6nbelle\u011Fi do\u011Frulay\u0131n. npm ve PyPI yay\u0131n\u0131n\u0131 OIDC ile, uzun \xF6m\xFCrl\xFC token olmadan yap\u0131n. Rotasyonun tamamland\u0131\u011F\u0131n\u0131 bir kontrol listesiyle do\u011Frulay\u0131n.",
