    "karar": "Gelir vergisi istisnas\u0131 / \xFCcret niteli\u011Fi belirsiz \xF6demeler (yemek, ula\u015F\u0131m, \u0131s\u0131nma, kira, e\u011Fitim vb. yan haklar; \xFCcret mi, istisna m\u0131, SGK primine esas m\u0131)",
    "neden": "\u0130stisna tutarlar\u0131 ve ko\u015Fullar\u0131 tebli\u011Flerle s\u0131k de\u011Fi\u015Fir (\xF6r. GVGT 322 \u0131s\u0131nma \xF6demesi istisnas\u0131; 7566/7577 say\u0131l\u0131 Kanunlarla yemek bedeli istisnas\u0131 de\u011Fi\u015Fiklikleri \u2014 \u0130SMMMO e-kitap \xF6zeti). Belirsiz durumlar i\xE7in G\u0130B \xF6zelge sistemi vard\u0131r; \xF6zelgeler yaln\u0131zca talep eden m\xFCkellefi ba\u011Flar ve yorum farkl\u0131l\u0131klar\u0131 olabilir. Yeni bir yan hak tipinin s\u0131n\u0131fland\u0131r\u0131lmas\u0131 SMMM/vergi uzman\u0131 karar\u0131 gerektirir.",
