    "neden": "\xDCcret hesap pusulas\u0131n\u0131n KEP ile verilmesinin md.37'yi kar\u015F\u0131lad\u0131\u011F\u0131 y\xF6n\xFCndeki \xC7SGB g\xF6r\xFC\u015F\xFC (13.11.2017) idari g\xF6r\xFC\u015Ft\xFCr; delil de\u011Feri HMK 199/205 ve 5070 md.5 \xE7er\xE7evesinde de\u011Ferlendirilir. Uygulama bi\xE7imi (\xE7al\u0131\u015Fan\u0131n KEP adresi, imza/m\xFCh\xFCr t\xFCr\xFC) i\xE7in \u0130K hukuk\xE7usu onay\u0131 gerekir.",
