        "DoD'a en yak\u0131n b\xFCy\xFCk greenfield: Anthropic C derleyicisi (~100K sat\u0131r, 16 ajan, GCC torture %99, Linux derliyor) \u2013 ama hello-world/assembler/performans a\xE7\u0131klar\u0131 kald\u0131.",
