      icerik: "# E3 \u2014 Risk haritas\u0131: Codex kar\u015F\u0131la\u015Ft\u0131rmas\u0131 (\xF6zet)\n\nTarih: 2026-09-27 \xB7 Ayr\u0131nt\u0131l\u0131 kay\u0131t: `E3-codex-risk.json`\n\n## Ne kar\u015F\u0131la\u015Ft\u0131r\u0131ld\u0131\n- **Codex:** `arac-riskleri/` (271 ara\xE7 profili, 102 ko\u015Fullu risk, 37 g\xFCvenlik bildirimi, 72 \xFCr\xFCn belgesi g\xF6zlemi, 12 bile\u015Fik zincir, 48 ara\xE7 seti) ve ham `tmp/risk-arastirmasi/` (696 depo bildirimi, 409 kaynak dosyas\u0131).\n- **Biz:** `risk-haritasi/` (4.382 ara\xE7, 2.489 bulgu, 320 olay, 115 senaryo).\n- Codex dizini yaln\u0131zca okundu; kar\u015F\u0131la\u015Ft\u0131rma scratchpad'deki kopyalar \xFCzerinde betikle yap\u0131ld\u0131.\n\n## Eklenenler (hepsi birincil kaynakla do\u011Fruland\u0131)\n- **25 yeni bulgu (BL-02491\u2026BL-02515):**\n  - **14 g\xFCvenlik bildirimi bulgusu.** GitHub bildirim API'si, NVD ve CISA KEV ile kar\u015F\u0131la\u015Ft\u0131r\u0131ld\u0131. \xD6ne \xE7\u0131kanlar:\n    - Langflow: \xFC\xE7 KEV kayd\u0131 ve 24 ayda 32 bildirim (15 kritik).\n    - Flowise: 130 bildirim (41 kritik) ve yamas\u0131z \xE7al\u0131\u015Fma alan\u0131 ayr\u0131m\u0131 a\xE7\u0131klar\u0131.\n    - OpenClaw: 8 ayda 722 bildirim, onay ba\u011F\u0131n\u0131n atlat\u0131lmas\u0131.\n    - FastMCP: CVE-2026-32871 (CVSS 10.0).\n    - Di\u011Ferleri: Argo CD, Keycloak (42 bildirim), Dify, Strands, n8n, vLLM, LiteLLM CVE-2026-59822 (KEV), Deep Agents.\n  - **11 belgelenmi\u015F \xFCr\xFCn s\u0131n\u0131r\u0131.** Her biri resm\xEE belgeden okundu:\n    - Ollama ve Grafana Loki'de yerle\u015Fik kimlik do\u011Frulamas\u0131 yok.\n    - E2B'de `allowOut` verilmezse d\u0131\u015Far\u0131ya t\xFCm trafik a\xE7\u0131k.\n    - Mastra'da kimlik do\u011Frulama yap\u0131land\u0131r\u0131lmazsa Studio herkese a\xE7\u0131k.\n    - DevUI \xFCretim kullan\u0131m\u0131 i\xE7in tasarlanmam\u0131\u015F.\n    - Claude Code sandbox vekili TLS i\xE7eri\u011Fini incelemiyor.\n    - smolagents'\u0131n yerel y\xFCr\xFCt\xFCc\xFCs\xFC bir g\xFCvenlik s\u0131n\u0131r\u0131 de\u011Fil.\n    - Vault'ta denetim cihaz\u0131 eri\u015Filemezse hizmet de durur.\n    - Argo CD'de otomatik senkron a\xE7\u0131kken rollback yap\u0131lam\u0131yor.\n    - restic `check` veri bloklar\u0131n\u0131 okumuyor.\n    - Weaviate yedekleri FROZEN kirac\u0131lar\u0131 atl\u0131yor.\n- **3 olay:**\n  - EV-321: Langflow CVE-2026-33017 KEV'e eklendi.\n  - EV-322: LiteLLM CVE-2026-59822 KEV'e eklendi.\n  - EV-323: Flowise'\u0131n yamas\u0131z kirac\u0131lar aras\u0131 ve SSO bildirimleri.\n- **4 senaryo.** Codex zincirleri Z-05, Z-03, Z-09 ve Z-10'dan uyarland\u0131 ve ger\xE7ek \xF6rnekle desteklendi:\n  - SS-116: onay ba\u011F\u0131n\u0131n atlat\u0131lmas\u0131.\n  - SS-117: payla\u015F\u0131lan platformda ekip s\u0131n\u0131r\u0131n\u0131n delinmesi.\n  - SS-118: metrik etiketi patlamas\u0131yla olay zincirinin kaybolmas\u0131.\n  - SS-119: ye\u015Fil g\xF6r\xFCnen yede\u011Fin kurtar\u0131lamamas\u0131.\n- **KEV \xE7apraz kontrol\xFC.** Codex'in \"KEV'de tam CVE e\u015Fle\u015Fmesi\" y\xF6ntemi haritam\u0131zdaki b\xFCt\xFCn CVE'lere uyguland\u0131.\n  - 24 CVE KEV katalo\u011Funda \xE7\u0131kt\u0131.\n  - Bunlara ait 30 e\u015Fle\u015Fmenin 12'sinde KEV bilgisi yoktu.\n  - 8 bulguya `kev_durumu` alan\u0131, 10 arac\u0131n `guvenlik_gecmisi` b\xF6l\xFCm\xFCne `cisa_kev` listesi eklendi (Vitest, Trivy, MLflow, LiteLLM, GitLab ve di\u011Ferleri).\n- **Ek:** vLLM'in g\xFCvenlik ge\xE7mi\u015Fine CVE-2025-29783 eklendi. \u0130ki mevcut bulguya d\xFCzeltme notu (`e3_notu`) yaz\u0131ld\u0131.\n\n## Puan etkisi\n- 13 ara\xE7 otomatik kapsamdan derin kapsama ge\xE7ti.\n- Langflow 5 \u2192 58 oldu (d\xFC\u015F\xFCk \u2192 y\xFCksek). Flowise 20 \u2192 57 ve OpenClaw 15 \u2192 49 oldu (ikisi de y\xFCksek).\n- LiteLLM 80 puanla en riskli ara\xE7 oldu.\n- Toplamlar: 2.514 bulgu, 323 olay, 119 senaryo, 636 derin ara\u015Ft\u0131r\u0131lm\u0131\u015F ara\xE7.\n\n## \xC7eli\u015Fkiler\n- **FastMCP CVE-2026-32871.** Codex \"high\" yazm\u0131\u015F. GitHub'\u0131n incelenmi\u015F kayd\u0131 \"critical, 10.0\". Depo etiketi \"high\"; do\u011Frusu global kay\u0131t.\n- **Haystack CVE-2024-41950.** Codex \"low\" yazm\u0131\u015F (depo etiketi). Global kay\u0131t \"high, 7.5\". Bizdeki bulguya not eklendi.\n- **n8n GHSA-x5vx.** Codex'te CVE yok; kayda CVE-2026-65015 atanm\u0131\u015F. Codex iki dall\u0131 s\xFCr\xFCm aral\u0131klar\u0131n\u0131 tek aral\u0131\u011Fa indirmi\u015F.\n- **Tarihler.** Codex depo bildirimi tarihini, biz global kay\u0131t tarihini kullanm\u0131\u015F\u0131z; ikisi de do\u011Fru. MLflow GHSA-gqvg'ye ilk yay\u0131m (2026-07-27) notu eklendi.\n- **Langflow.** Bizde 0 bulgu ve \"d\xFC\u015F\xFCk\" seviye vard\u0131. Oysa \xFC\xE7 KEV kayd\u0131 var (Codex nihai atlasa yaln\u0131z ikisini alm\u0131\u015F). Do\u011Frusu Codex'inkinden de a\u011F\u0131r.\n- **Codex ham say\u0131lar\u0131.** Codex yaln\u0131z ilk sayfay\u0131 alm\u0131\u015F (Flowise ve OpenClaw i\xE7in 100'er kay\u0131t). Tam liste: Flowise 130, OpenClaw 722.\n\n## Eklenmeyenler\n- **102 ko\u015Fullu risk, 48 ara\xE7 seti riski, 16 bo\u015Fluk ve 12 k\xF6r nokta.** Bunlar olas\u0131l\u0131\u011F\u0131 verilmemi\u015F analist hipotezleri. Mekanizmalar\u0131 bizdeki risk t\xFCrleri, kal\u0131plar ve senaryolarda zaten kar\u015F\u0131lan\u0131yor.\n- **8 zincir.** Bir k\u0131sm\u0131 mevcut senaryolarla \xF6rt\xFC\u015F\xFCyor. Z-06 ve Z-08 i\xE7in do\u011Frulanm\u0131\u015F ger\xE7ek \xF6rnek bulunamad\u0131.\n- **61 \xFCr\xFCn belgesi g\xF6zlemi.** Keycloak'a ait OG-019 do\u011Frulanamad\u0131; bir k\u0131sm\u0131 bizde zaten var.\n- **Ham ara\u015Ft\u0131rmada kalan 559 bildirim.** 31 kritik, 230 y\xFCksek, 260 orta, 38 d\xFC\u015F\xFCk; 117'si 24 ayl\u0131k pencerenin d\u0131\u015F\u0131nda. Kritiklerin pencere i\xE7inde kalanlar\u0131 ara\xE7 d\xFCzeyindeki toplu bulgularda say\u0131 olarak yer al\u0131yor.\n\n## Bizde olup Codex'te olmayanlar\n- T\xFCm ara\xE7lar i\xE7in puan ve olas\u0131l\u0131k; 320 olay (Codex'te olay kayd\u0131 yok); ger\xE7ek \xF6rnekli 115 senaryo.\n- Lisans, sahiplik, sat\u0131c\u0131 kilidi, KVKK ve jeopolitik risk t\xFCrleri; T\xFCrk hukuku kararlar\u0131; program risk kayd\u0131 ba\u011Flant\u0131lar\u0131.\n\n## Notlar\n- \xDCretici betik (`risk_birlestir.py`) klas\xF6rleri silip yeniden \xFCretti\u011Fi i\xE7in \xE7al\u0131\u015Ft\u0131r\u0131lmad\u0131. T\xFCretilmi\u015F saya\xE7lar ayn\u0131 form\xFCllerle yerinde g\xFCncellendi.\n- Tutarl\u0131l\u0131k denetimi s\u0131f\u0131r hata verdi. Eski bulgular\u0131n hi\xE7biri silinmedi ya da de\u011Fi\u015Ftirilmedi.\n- Otomatikten derine ge\xE7en ara\xE7lar\u0131n puan\u0131, \xF6nceki otomatik puan\u0131n alt\u0131na d\xFC\u015F\xFCr\xFClmedi (`puan_notu` alan\u0131).\n- **\xD6neri:** KEV'de olan CVE'lere ba\u011Fl\u0131 bulgularda olas\u0131l\u0131k \"y\xFCksek\"e \xE7ekilmeli. Bu turda mevcut de\u011Ferler de\u011Fi\u015Ftirilmedi.\n",
      tur: "text/markdown"
