      sha256: "546518595d072d4929a9b3d9da75e32ff00c6632b2092afa51eb0ea675274d04",
      icerik: "\xC7al\u0131\u015Fma k\xF6k\xFCm `/Users/w6x/Documents/otomasyon coding 2`. \xD6nce `DEVIR-TESLIM.md` ve `devir-teslim/00_BURADAN_BASLA.md` dosyalar\u0131n\u0131 oku; oradaki okuma s\u0131ras\u0131n\u0131 ve devir s\xF6zle\u015Fmesini uygula. Bu dosyalar \xF6nceki hesab\u0131n ta\u015F\u0131nabilir haf\u0131zas\u0131d\u0131r. Ge\xE7mi\u015F konu\u015Fmaya eri\u015Fti\u011Fini veya dosyalar\u0131 okumadan bildi\u011Fini varsayma.\n\n\u0130stedi\u011Fim: insan\u0131n g\xF6rev formunu doldurup \xE7\u0131kt\u0131y\u0131 incelemesi; i\xE7eride ajanlar\u0131n geli\u015Ftirme, test, t\u0131kan\u0131kl\u0131k \xE7\xF6z\xFCm\xFC, birle\u015Ftirme ve uzak alpha teslimini y\xFCr\xFCtmesi. \xC7ok ekipli, b\xFCy\xFCyebilen, ara\xE7lar\u0131 kadar s\xFCre\xE7 ve mimarisi de de\u011Fi\u015Febilen sistem. Plane/OpenHands/n8n/Kestra/Temporal \xF6rnekleri nihai teknoloji se\xE7imi de\u011Fildir. Ara\u015Ft\u0131rmay\u0131 yeniden ba\u015Flat\u0131p yaln\u0131z rapor teslim etme; mevcut bulgu ve kabul ko\u015Fullar\u0131ndan \xE7al\u0131\u015F\u0131r somut dilime ilerle.\n\nHen\xFCz canl\u0131 fabrika kurulmad\u0131. Temporal pilotunda ger\xE7ek motor kullan\u0131ld\u0131 ama model/GitHub/deploy fixture; 12 birim/9 motor senaryosu, ayr\u0131 30 sentetik politika testi ve dar motor hata deneyi tam \xFCr\xFCn kabul\xFC de\u011Fildir. Son 28 bulgu/16 s\xF6zle\u015Fme d\xFCzeltmesi belgelendi, 28 kabul deneyi \xE7al\u0131\u015Ft\u0131r\u0131lmad\u0131. Platform se\xE7imi a\xE7\u0131k. G\xFCncel otorite `agentic-sistem/data/12_fabrika_cercevesi` ile 13/14/15 ekleri; runtime s\u0131n\u0131r\u0131 `uygulama/status.json` ve `data/09_dogrulama/02_teslim_durumu.json` birlikte.\n\nClaude \xE7al\u0131\u015Fma dizini `/Users/w6x/Documents/otomasyon coding` salt okunur: okuma/kopyalama m\xFCmk\xFCn, d\xFCzenleme/silme/\xE7al\u0131\u015Ft\u0131rma yok. Mevcut kan\u0131tlar\u0131, tarihsel raporlar\u0131 ve kaynak kopyalar\u0131n\u0131 koru. Yeni Git author/committer `karacaismail <35493655+karacaismail@users.noreply.github.com>`; guard'\u0131 a\u015Fma, AI/co-author imzas\u0131 ekleme. Mac'te Colima `factory` profili kullan\u0131l\u0131r; \xE7al\u0131\u015Fan kullan\u0131c\u0131 servislerini izinsiz yeniden ba\u015Flatma. Ayr\u0131nt\u0131l\u0131 kal\u0131c\u0131 kurallar `devir-teslim/POLITIKALAR.md`.\n\n\xD6nce dosya referanslar\u0131yla hedefi, yap\u0131lm\u0131\u015F olan\u0131, yap\u0131lmam\u0131\u015F\u0131 ve ilk somut ad\u0131m\u0131 do\u011Fru anlad\u0131\u011F\u0131n\u0131 g\xF6ster. `devir-sozlesmesi.json` devralma alan\u0131n\u0131 ancak okuduktan sonra doldur. Sonra yetkili ve ba\u011F\u0131ms\u0131z yerel i\u015Fi s\xFCrd\xFCr; yaln\u0131z ger\xE7ekten gerekli alan karar\u0131 veya d\u0131\u015F ba\u011Flant\u0131 bilgisi i\xE7in k\u0131sa soru sor. Gizli bilgileri sohbete isteme. \u0130ddia edilen ba\u015Far\u0131y\u0131 hangi ger\xE7ek kan\u0131t\u0131n destekledi\u011Fini a\xE7\u0131k tut.\n",
      tur: "text/markdown"
