      icerik: "# Kald\u0131\u011F\u0131m\u0131z yerden somut devam\n\nBu s\u0131ra bir teslim program\u0131 veya s\xFCre taahh\xFCd\xFC de\u011Fildir. Yeni hesab\u0131n ara\u015Ft\u0131rmay\u0131 ba\u015Fa sarmadan ger\xE7ek sonuca ilerlemesi i\xE7in \xF6nerilen uygulama s\u0131ras\u0131d\u0131r. Nihai teknoloji se\xE7imi yap\u0131lmam\u0131\u015Ft\u0131r.\n\n## 1. Ger\xE7eklik kayd\u0131n\u0131 devral\n\nDevir s\xF6zle\u015Fmesini oku; dosya haritas\u0131n\u0131 salt okunur do\u011Frula. `uygulama/status.json` ile `data/09_dogrulama/02_teslim_durumu.json`u birlikte oku. \u0130lk \xE7\u0131kt\u0131: hangi kodun ger\xE7ek, hangi s\u0131n\u0131r\u0131n benzetimli, hangi tasar\u0131m\u0131n uygulanmam\u0131\u015F oldu\u011Funu do\u011Fru s\xF6yleyen k\u0131sa durum kayd\u0131. Bu i\u015Flem yeni ara\u015Ft\u0131rma gerektirmez.\n\n## 2. Tek ger\xE7ek teslim yolculu\u011Funu se\xE7ilebilir hale getir\n\nKullan\u0131c\u0131n\u0131n mevcut g\xF6rev kayna\u011F\u0131ndan bir ger\xE7ek ama s\u0131n\u0131rlar\u0131 belirli i\u015F, hedef repo/branch, alpha ortam\u0131, kabul \xF6l\xE7\xFCtleri ve ba\u011F\u0131ms\u0131z beklenen sonu\xE7 gerekli. Yap\u0131lacak i\u015Fi ajan kendi testleriyle tan\u0131mlamas\u0131n. HRMS ba\u015Flang\u0131c\u0131 se\xE7ilirse tek men\xFCn\xFCn g\xF6r\xFCnmesi yerine i\u015Flevler aras\u0131 k\xFC\xE7\xFCk bir yolculuk d\xFC\u015F\xFCn; ancak \xFClke/d\xF6nem/\xFCcret gibi kurallar\u0131 uydurma.\n\nKullan\u0131c\u0131dan yaln\u0131z ger\xE7ekten eksik olan i\u015F karar\u0131 ve eri\u015Fim e\u015Flemesini iste. Ayn\u0131 anda yerel form, s\xF6zle\u015Fme testleri, fixturelar ve adapt\xF6r yeterlilik ko\u015Fullar\u0131 haz\u0131rlanabilir. \u201CT\xFCm ba\u011Flant\u0131lar\u0131 ver, sonra ba\u015Flar\u0131m\u201D deme. Repo ad\u0131 `alpha`, alpha branch'i ve alpha ortam\u0131 ayr\u0131 alanlar olsun.\n\n## 3. Motor/ajan aday\u0131n\u0131 ayn\u0131 s\u0131n\u0131rda de\u011Ferlendir\n\nMevcut pilotu ve haz\u0131r bile\u015Fenleri birer aday kabul et. Dar yolculukta ger\xE7ek g\xF6rev al\u0131m\u0131, g\xFCvenli \xE7al\u0131\u015Ft\u0131rma, ba\u011F\u0131ms\u0131z do\u011Frulama, retry/iptal ve teslim makbuzu testini ge\xE7en en az karma\u015F\u0131k bile\u015Fimi belirle. Se\xE7imi \xF6l\xE7\xFClen gerek\xE7e ve a\xE7\u0131k \xE7\u0131k\u0131\u015F yolu ile kaydet. Yeni ara\u015Ft\u0131rma yaln\u0131z aday\u0131n bu testteki bilinmeyeni i\xE7in yap\u0131l\u0131r. Haz\u0131r kodlay\u0131c\u0131 kullanmak, b\xFCt\xFCn fabrikan\u0131n o \xFCr\xFCne teslim edildi\u011Fi anlam\u0131na gelmez.\n\n## 4. \xD6nce i\u015F ve yetki kayb\u0131n\u0131 \xF6nleyen s\u0131n\u0131rlar\u0131 uygula\n\n- Kaynak edisyonuna uygun ger\xE7ek olay fixture\u0131, imza/kimlik do\u011Frulamas\u0131, kal\u0131c\u0131 inbox ve ba\u011F\u0131ms\u0131z uzla\u015Ft\u0131rma (DE-01/02, DR-C01/02).\n- Tek yetkili i\u015F nesli, iptal/red kayd\u0131, eski yaz\u0131c\u0131n\u0131n etki yetkisini kesen denetim ve d\u0131\u015F i\u015Flem makbuzu (DR-C01/03).\n- Sabit politika/ara\xE7/skill s\xFCr\xFCm\xFC ve son tree'ye ba\u011Fl\u0131 kan\u0131t (DR-C04/06).\n- G\xFCvenlik arac\u0131 hatas\u0131n\u0131 ba\u015Far\u0131 saymayan kap\u0131; onaydan sonraki de\u011Fi\u015Fiklikte kan\u0131t\u0131n yenilenmesi (DP-01/03/09).\n\nKabul: \xE7ift/gecikmi\u015F olay, cevap kayb\u0131, insan reddi yar\u0131\u015F\u0131, yanl\u0131\u015F proje y\xF6nlendirmesi ve de\u011Fi\u015Fen politika yanl\u0131\u015F teslim \xFCretmemeli. Bunlar yaln\u0131z test ba\u015Fl\u0131\u011F\u0131 olarak yaz\u0131l\u0131 kalmamal\u0131.\n\n## 5. Bir \xE7al\u0131\u015Fan\u0131 ger\xE7ek geli\u015Ftirme ve alpha teslimine ba\u011Fla\n\nGer\xE7ek model/ajan ve izole \xE7al\u0131\u015Fma alan\u0131; kaynak kodu, test/oracle b\xFCt\xFCnl\xFC\u011F\xFC, CI sonu\xE7lar\u0131 ve g\xFCncel trunk do\u011Frulamas\u0131; son artifact ile hedef alpha'n\u0131n kimlik e\u015Fle\u015Fmesi. Ba\u015Far\u0131l\u0131 yolda tek ger\xE7ek g\xF6rev i\xE7in ba\u011F\u0131ms\u0131z kan\u0131t paketi \xFCret. \u0130nsan inceleme oturumu belirli s\xFCr\xFCm ve veri setine ba\u011Fl\u0131 olsun. \u0130nsan reddi issue/yeni g\xF6reve kay\u0131ps\u0131z d\xF6ns\xFCn; normal yolun gizli terminal/GUI m\xFCdahalesine ihtiyac\u0131 kalmas\u0131n.\n\n## 6. Ayn\u0131 yolda ar\u0131zay\u0131 ve toparlanmay\u0131 s\u0131na\n\nUzun me\u015Fru test; ger\xE7ekten ilerlemeyen ajan; s\u0131n\u0131rl\u0131 cgroup OOM; model/API kota beklemesi; worker kayb\u0131; belirsiz push/deploy sonucu; bozuk alpha'n\u0131n onar\u0131m\u0131; ge\xE7 tamamlanan eski da\u011F\u0131t\u0131m. Toparlanman\u0131n sonucu ba\u011F\u0131ms\u0131z \xF6l\xE7\xFCls\xFCn. Yaln\u0131z retry say\u0131s\u0131n\u0131 art\u0131rma veya g\xF6zlemcinin sorunu loglamas\u0131n\u0131 \xE7\xF6z\xFCm sayma. Ger\xE7ek OOM deneyini kullan\u0131c\u0131 servislerinden izole ve s\u0131n\u0131rl\u0131 kapsamda tasarla.\n\n## 7. Kapsam ve ortak kapasiteyi koruyarak \xE7o\u011Falt\n\n\xD6nce birka\xE7 g\xF6revde ortak RAM/CPU/model kotas\u0131/b\xFCt\xE7e rezervasyonu, adalet, \xE7ak\u0131\u015Fan kod de\u011Fi\u015Fikli\u011Fi ve birle\u015Fik \xFCr\xFCn y\xFCk\xFCml\xFCl\xFCklerini kan\u0131tla. Yedi alt i\u015Fi alt\u0131ya kesmek gibi kay\u0131plar kapan\u0131\u015F\u0131 engellesin. Sonra 12 ve 12 \xD7 12 mant\u0131ksal d\xFCzeye \xF6l\xE7\xFCmle ilerle. 128/256/512 GB \xF6nerisi \xF6l\xE7\xFClen \xE7al\u0131\u015Fma seti ve darbo\u011Faza dayanmal\u0131; insan/ajan say\u0131s\u0131 RAM'den tek ba\u015F\u0131na hesaplanamaz.\n\n## 8. \u0130\u015Fletim ve de\u011Fi\u015Fim tatbikat\u0131yla kabul et\n\nYedek/geri y\xFCkleme, sunucu kayb\u0131, s\xFCr\xFCm ge\xE7i\u015Fi, iptal edilmi\u015F izin ve ger\xE7ek bir ara\xE7 de\u011Fi\u015Ftirme deneyini tamamla. Bir g\xF6revin eski s\xFCr\xFCmde bitmesi, kay\u0131tl\u0131 devri veya kontroll\xFC yeniden ba\u015Flamas\u0131 bilin\xE7li se\xE7ilsin. Post-MVP ve olgunluk a\u015Famalar\u0131 tarihle de\u011Fil bu yeteneklerin kan\u0131t\u0131yla ilerlesin.\n\n## Bir sonraki hesab\u0131n ilk \xE7al\u0131\u015Fma \xE7\u0131kt\u0131s\u0131\n\nKod de\u011Fi\u015Fikli\u011Fi gerekiyorsa mevcut a\xE7\u0131klarla e\u015Fle\u015Fen **tek uygulanabilir teslim dilimi**, anlaml\u0131 testleri ve kalan s\u0131n\u0131rlar\u0131 \xFCret. Kullan\u0131c\u0131ya yeniden uzun ara\xE7 katalo\u011Fu sunma. Hedef haz\u0131r kabul edilmediyse bunu nedenleriyle s\xF6yle; \u201Csadece token eksik\u201D diye k\u0131saltma. [A\xE7\u0131k i\u015Flerin makine kayd\u0131](07_MEVCUT_DURUM.json) devam\u0131n ba\u015Flang\u0131c\u0131d\u0131r.\n",
