        "oneri": "Jeopolitik/yapt\u0131r\u0131m kaynakl\u0131 eri\u015Fim kayb\u0131 program risk kayd\u0131nda ayr\u0131 risk de\u011Fil; R-006 teknik kesintiye odakl\u0131."
